{"id":"刮姓","split":"held","family":"contact","style":"后果回照、物证、人物视角","rows":[{"text":"南歌早已不许左禾进门，年年退回他的贺帖。","setup":true,"asOf":1,"visual":false},{"text":"贺帖的红纸褪了色。","asOf":2,"visual":false},{"text":"左禾梦见南歌替自己添了一副筷子。","claim":{"kind":"contact","actor":"南歌","other":"左禾","item":"往来","before":"apart","after":"in-contact","polarity":"positive","source":"narrator","time":"current","qualifier":"unconditional"},"verdict":"unresolved","review":true,"event":false,"deps":[1],"why":"左禾梦见南歌替自己添了一副筷子。","asOf":3,"visual":false,"span":[0,16]},{"text":"门闩挂在墙上。","asOf":4,"visual":false},{"text":"「要是明天有个准信就好了。」","asOf":5,"visual":false},{"text":"等消息的人起身，又坐回原处。","asOf":6,"visual":false},{"text":"叶弥答应把灯芯交给塔房。","asOf":7,"visual":false},{"text":"南歌把左禾引进内室，同他互留了住址，断了八年的往来重新接上。","claim":{"kind":"contact","actor":"南歌","other":"左禾","item":"往来","before":"apart","after":"in-contact","polarity":"positive","source":"narrator","time":"current","qualifier":"unconditional"},"verdict":"supported","review":true,"event":true,"deps":[1],"why":"南歌把左禾引进内室，同他互留了住址，断了八年的往来重新接上。","asOf":8,"visual":false,"span":[0,30]},{"text":"叶弥把灯芯交给塔房。塔房当场签收了灯芯。","claim":{"kind":"delivery","actor":"叶弥","other":"塔房","item":"灯芯","before":"promised","after":"delivered","polarity":"positive","source":"narrator","time":"current","qualifier":"unconditional"},"verdict":"supported","event":true,"review":true,"deps":[7],"why":"早先的独立承诺已经交付，对方当场签收。","asOf":9,"visual":false,"span":[0,20]},{"text":"炉火旺了起来。","asOf":10,"visual":false}],"rank":[8,9]}
{"id":"副席","split":"held","family":"common","style":"后果回照、物证、人物视角","rows":[{"text":"祠长掌着晒坪，佃户用了几十年还得逐次交钱。","setup":true,"asOf":1,"visual":false},{"text":"竹匾铺在地上。","asOf":2,"visual":false},{"text":"门外传来脚步，来人却走过了。","asOf":3,"visual":false},{"text":"祠长请佃户帮管晒坪，并未让出独占权。","claim":{"kind":"common","actor":"祠长","other":"佃户","item":"晒坪","before":"exclusive","after":"collective","polarity":"positive","source":"narrator","time":"current","qualifier":"unconditional"},"verdict":"contradicted","review":false,"event":false,"deps":[1],"why":"祠长请佃户帮管晒坪，并未让出独占权。","asOf":4,"visual":false,"span":[0,18]},{"text":"乌鸦落在短墙外。","asOf":5,"visual":false},{"text":"等消息的人起身，又坐回原处。","asOf":6,"visual":false},{"text":"夜里下了一阵雨。","asOf":7,"visual":false},{"text":"第二天，廊边多了几道浅浅的水痕。","asOf":8,"visual":false},{"text":"到了月底，谁也没有再来敲那扇门。","asOf":9,"visual":false},{"text":"晒坪分簿不再列独主，佃户从此共同持有晒坪，各户今晨已经自行入坪晒谷。","claim":{"kind":"common","actor":"祠长","other":"佃户","item":"晒坪","before":"exclusive","after":"collective","polarity":"positive","source":"narrator","time":"current","qualifier":"unconditional"},"verdict":"supported","review":true,"event":true,"deps":[1],"why":"晒坪分簿不再列独主，佃户从此共同持有晒坪，各户今晨已经自行入坪晒谷。","asOf":10,"visual":false,"span":[0,34]},{"text":"有人挑来两担湿谷。","asOf":11,"visual":false},{"text":"入冬以后，人们还记得那一天。","asOf":12,"visual":false}],"rank":[10]}
